{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2615 A Shop Survivor Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life in Jasskia: A Coffee Shop</strong> is a shop survivor simulator set in a crumbling economy.<br>Build your caf\u00e9, serve perfect espresso shots, and try to stay afloat in a country ruled by inflation, taxes, bribes, and harsh deadlines.<br>It's not just about brewing coffee. It's about outlasting the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae What You\u2019ll Do</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Build your caf\u00e9 from scratch</strong></u><br>Start with an empty shop. Buy equipment like espresso machines, counters, speakers, and delivery tables. Place them anywhere\u2014layout affects flow and efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/cc84a5c92109fd8984cbbd1b66be17f2.poster.avif?t=1753484894\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/cc84a5c92109fd8984cbbd1b66be17f2.webm?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/cc84a5c92109fd8984cbbd1b66be17f2.mp4?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83d\udccb <strong>Create and manage your menu</strong></u><br>You know every coffee recipe. What you can sell depends on what machines and ingredients you can afford. Want to serve cold brew? Buy the cold brew machine and add it to your menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/f81e7053e7a0f350c5792cd9ed597689.poster.avif?t=1753484894\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/f81e7053e7a0f350c5792cd9ed597689.webm?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Take orders, make drinks, get paid</strong></u><br>Customers queue, place their orders, and expect fast service. Make coffee manually or hire workers to automate. From espresso to ristretto, every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/4bb71c0178099dad1db26099edf582f3.poster.avif?t=1753484894\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/4bb71c0178099dad1db26099edf582f3.webm?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/4bb71c0178099dad1db26099edf582f3.mp4?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Price your drinks in an unstable economy</strong></u><br>All prices are in Jasskian Lida (JL), but the market is tied to a volatile dollar exchange rate. Daily price shifts mean that what you earned yesterday might be worthless tomorrow.<br>Track trends, adjust prices, and don\u2019t let your savings rot\u2014invest smart or get crushed by inflation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/2e0139721a8632c6b2da0f9ea6cb2840.poster.avif?t=1753484894\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/2e0139721a8632c6b2da0f9ea6cb2840.webm?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Hire staff and scale up</strong></u><br>Bring in cashiers, baristas, and delivery runners. Expand your space, add more machines, and handle more customers\u2014if you can afford the extra rent and wages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/f74e4d6585b4d15c997bffc0f6d1601b.poster.avif?t=1753484894\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/f74e4d6585b4d15c997bffc0f6d1601b.webm?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 Survive the System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Jasskia, missing a payment isn\u2019t just bad\u2014it\u2019s lethal for your business.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget to pay rent, taxes, or loans within two weeks? The government shuts you down. Game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall behind on electricity bills or extortion payments? Your caf\u00e9 is locked until you pay\u2014if you can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disappoint customers with slow service? Reputation drops. Fewer visitors. Lower prices. A death spiral begins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold onto your JL savings too long? Inflation eats it alive. What could\u2019ve bought a machine yesterday buys you nothing tomorrow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win, you must deliver great coffee <i>and</i> navigate a collapsing financial system designed to crush you.<br>There\u2019s only one rule in Jasskia: <strong>pay on time or close your doors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/a6dc2433eb2419ace9937aa7ea751e34.poster.avif?t=1753484894\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/a6dc2433eb2419ace9937aa7ea751e34.webm?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/a6dc2433eb2419ace9937aa7ea751e34.mp4?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Development in Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life in Jasskia: A Coffee Shop</strong> is currently in active development.<br>The core gameplay loop is fully playable and represents the foundation of the final game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned systems currently in design or testing include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coffee machine maintenance</strong> \u2013 Machines will break down over time, forcing you to manage repairs or face slower service.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Caf\u00e9 cleanliness</strong> \u2013 Dirt and clutter will reduce customer satisfaction, forcing you to clean and optimize your workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More recipes, machines, and visual upgrades</strong> \u2013 New tools will open up new strategies and customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded financial systems</strong> \u2013 Fines, audits, and reputation-based regulation may challenge even veteran players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether these features launch during beta or post-release depends on development support and community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/9cf30682ee5d41febedc72bc76e76805.poster.avif?t=1753484894\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/9cf30682ee5d41febedc72bc76e76805.webm?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcec Add to Your Wishlist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life in Jasskia: A Coffee Shop</strong> is being built by a solo developer who believes that survival mechanics and cozy visuals can (and should) coexist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're interested in a different kind of caf\u00e9 sim\u2014one that challenges you to think, adapt, and pay attention to more than just foam quality\u2014add the game to your wishlist and follow the development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New systems, updates, and demos will be announced here first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880150?t=1753484894","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880150?t=1753484894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/ae9c170c4e1de1f66af5006e21974072d9c1f000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753484894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/ae9c170c4e1de1f66af5006e21974072d9c1f000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753484894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2615 A Shop Survivor Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life in Jasskia: A Coffee Shop</strong> is a shop survivor simulator set in a crumbling economy.<br>Build your caf\u00e9, serve perfect espresso shots, and try to stay afloat in a country ruled by inflation, taxes, bribes, and harsh deadlines.<br>It's not just about brewing coffee. It's about outlasting the system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae What You\u2019ll Do</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Build your caf\u00e9 from scratch</strong></u><br>Start with an empty shop. Buy equipment like espresso machines, counters, speakers, and delivery tables. Place them anywhere\u2014layout affects flow and efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/cc84a5c92109fd8984cbbd1b66be17f2.poster.avif?t=1753484894\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/cc84a5c92109fd8984cbbd1b66be17f2.webm?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/cc84a5c92109fd8984cbbd1b66be17f2.mp4?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83d\udccb <strong>Create and manage your menu</strong></u><br>You know every coffee recipe. What you can sell depends on what machines and ingredients you can afford. Want to serve cold brew? Buy the cold brew machine and add it to your menu.</p><p class=\"bb_par