"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/2e0139721a8632c6b2da0f9ea6cb2840.poster.avif?t=1753484894\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/2e0139721a8632c6b2da0f9ea6cb2840.webm?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Hire staff and scale up</strong></u><br>Bring in cashiers, baristas, and delivery runners. Expand your space, add more machines, and handle more customers\u2014if you can afford the extra rent and wages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/f74e4d6585b4d15c997bffc0f6d1601b.poster.avif?t=1753484894\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/f74e4d6585b4d15c997bffc0f6d1601b.webm?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 Survive the System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Jasskia, missing a payment isn\u2019t just bad\u2014it\u2019s lethal for your business.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget to pay rent, taxes, or loans within two weeks? The government shuts you down. Game over.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall behind on electricity bills or extortion payments? Your caf\u00e9 is locked until you pay\u2014if you can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disappoint customers with slow service? Reputation drops. Fewer visitors. Lower prices. A death spiral begins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold onto your JL savings too long? Inflation eats it alive. What could\u2019ve bought a machine yesterday buys you nothing tomorrow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win, you must deliver great coffee <i>and</i> navigate a collapsing financial system designed to crush you.<br>There\u2019s only one rule in Jasskia: <strong>pay on time or close your doors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/a6dc2433eb2419ace9937aa7ea751e34.poster.avif?t=1753484894\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/a6dc2433eb2419ace9937aa7ea751e34.webm?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/a6dc2433eb2419ace9937aa7ea751e34.mp4?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Development in Progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life in Jasskia: A Coffee Shop</strong> is currently in active development.<br>The core gameplay loop is fully playable and represents the foundation of the final game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned systems currently in design or testing include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coffee machine maintenance</strong> \u2013 Machines will break down over time, forcing you to manage repairs or face slower service.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Caf\u00e9 cleanliness</strong> \u2013 Dirt and clutter will reduce customer satisfaction, forcing you to clean and optimize your workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More recipes, machines, and visual upgrades</strong> \u2013 New tools will open up new strategies and customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded financial systems</strong> \u2013 Fines, audits, and reputation-based regulation may challenge even veteran players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether these features launch during beta or post-release depends on development support and community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/9cf30682ee5d41febedc72bc76e76805.poster.avif?t=1753484894\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/extras/9cf30682ee5d41febedc72bc76e76805.webm?t=1753484894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcec Add to Your Wishlist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life in Jasskia: A Coffee Shop</strong> is being built by a solo developer who believes that survival mechanics and cozy visuals can (and should) coexist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're interested in a different kind of caf\u00e9 sim\u2014one that challenges you to think, adapt, and pay attention to more than just foam quality\u2014add the game to your wishlist and follow the development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New systems, updates, and demos will be announced here first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Ak Ene Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880150/fc185810ce1055af920d4098ec4ce350d96da2f3/header.jpg?t=1753484894","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recomm